256→    **2. Create `apps/web/src/components/file-browser/SearchPalette.tsx`**
257→
258→    Command palette overlay with terminal aesthetic. Design specs from CONTEXT.md:
259→    - 600px wide, centered horizontally, ~120px from top
260→    - 1px #00D084 border, sharp corners (0 radius)
261→    - Backdrop: #000000CC
